      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61bae71cb056ac06b7af0a8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐，哥哥！\r\n用天使机伶的圣歌，\r\n来拯救你的灵魂吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c33c0f9c502e4b69fcd626f4285c6f93bf37316e7bed44fed5f208e59c1b1e2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c218220f015531b56a841214",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对机伶来说，\r\n圣诞节就是要和家人一起过。\r\n所以今晚……我就是要找哥哥。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77d964af4ca977001552de2727621065dc22951bc16fd38e998a0b1dfc7e5f7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6bba53e99d71c3288bea827",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太棒了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d84c74f65c150a848070eb17940288b4d4b73ed7ad14a80b46d2e75989d6a992",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20cb98f0b3f3722412f89239",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的机伶很可爱对吧。\r\n明年会让哥哥看到\r\n更可爱的机伶哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f61cf75cddc00a1fd431a12b35078c45ac351263d4251e2020a4ea81799511db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a41a143334691553848dcc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥，生日快乐！\r\n这个确定和机伶相遇的日子，\r\n我们得盛大地庆祝一番♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a603e8ad024d697538b47e1e6540be6ea487208c782b5e7d365c1c37adef9a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c321283ca6cf56ebc0dee994",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你……和我相遇。\r\n我真的、真的很开心哦。\r\n生日快乐，哥哥！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91c0890a662a862f99df716fe7d8f1e399330c7053d2542d5f4ac84907d3a639",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c79215685f45a0c73f376866",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我期待的生日礼物！\r\n那就是……和哥哥约会！\r\n要让我尽～情撒娇哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "324787e9ecb0df212e21d4d8147f7368f15d8df572277d77929adf57b38b9804",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19946e31ebf0420fb570c63d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的可爱\r\n在接下来的一年又要更新了……\r\n哥哥，你不可以眨眼哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e4f4bcbd532164bba2d89992b091db68d7da99746c4cddd46896646927551d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7e072f9eb65418bf5b027ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥，有公告诶！\r\n喂喂喂，内容是什么？\r\n机伶也想知道♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "deb4907390eba5f322a9c448f6080c840ce5528402fdb9fd1bf84912fa8c9c94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95092c58759ec95cbb78c20b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有礼物诶！\r\n哥哥真受欢迎。\r\n机伶可能都要吃醋了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6721058acad2e6a50d74f7ce04de0fa76b8aa2f8084c76867eacfb3a1eb16334",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:415cc1e8eba6da1d7a1deb28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害，你达成目标了！\r\n不愧是机伶的哥哥♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec32e17528ad6f3599def5c0b5821928aaec62beca1636ecfc3f76f1c89586f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f196da9b7ac4a4a80ec078ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『#活动就要开始　#pr』。\r\n希望是机伶备受瞩目的活动～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e312b8553c6428462be760f577c174d0db636d9633900f3b1d5c2f30840a1c9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:599314a774af324c99b38254",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶想去看看活动！\r\n喂喂，我们去瞧瞧吧？\r\n拜托嘛～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9a45fa45cb14e6b051653dc9da75af905d8b9f4837f6406a1a2c68418ef7a1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c91f4a970130afe3e7ce884",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……真可惜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e25f2b41f1ef974d43ce8241271308a48e0a2f6f0e5af24da347ea4080fde9ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff8a88b62a8220fa4f1d2384",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『#名册　#等级提升』。\r\n要确认一下哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f74f4cb4e26aab562bbb7abb49d4a91982e533b53869ab5226e3054faafe480",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d51f848cae1f7b2bfd0167a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "深红色很适合真机伶。一下子\r\n就会深深吸引人家的目光……\r\n看，你再也忘不掉了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "80a1610eafbf386a4424e66fc8888f8cb12b6edba9790a6539180f491de44056",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9637cac198ae13793663726",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿搭有许多规矩，但我现在重视的\r\n应该是平衡吧。比方说，像和哥哥\r\n站在一起时的……之类的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd27eeb9edde5f60d62705d662b5a04f27ce23db9fa41d706de539e9e2241182",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd427a6c96530e0a76fd4561",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "过去的服装我都统整在\r\n「#真机伶的穿搭」啰。如果有希望\r\n我挑战的打扮，再留言给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eae471a2f7d4ce8582c96e1782ac38a74c472718533b4db9fbf51030b59ce81f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb3eb2897348ec186aa88d67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，结果平手～",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaf5503a76cb9e4f9bfb3a9a36c589cb04c39bc0960fc2950535961cdf78a545",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b30a5506a2fb362ca09ba68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我们赢了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9142b9ba2b7d56bff2e78352c86f7a71fc7db34cb556f9722249648c5021c7cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52320675e4508e815cce123f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……真可惜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e25f2b41f1ef974d43ce8241271308a48e0a2f6f0e5af24da347ea4080fde9ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fe9490a6e1242a49491511c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，结果平手～",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaf5503a76cb9e4f9bfb3a9a36c589cb04c39bc0960fc2950535961cdf78a545",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
