      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a81651e2e41e01a4710ae33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要可爱地加油哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "16924de4c6f6715adf09d66bfff62fd0d65f415d4cbb4580dd54682aafc0ba26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d707b99da5a7d8e19c320ad8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受到全世界……不，受到全宇宙喜爱\r\n就会变得最可爱。\r\n姐姐，你也要爱我哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbc66f28b2e00aeb7b527e2acdeb425bddc1e2caeca1b0205e6f7d1fb6f22615",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55687d86e9d6e66dda831c72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，你刚刚在看机伶对吧？\r\n啊哈，如果是姐姐你～\r\n可以靠更近一点……也没关系呀♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6e65f595ab5b6de243bae220a75565455b9ff3cb17284c6ccce2bb6f04ceafa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a57c7a0ec701d55ae3940a80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想要巧克力还是机伶？\r\n……开玩笑的啦～机伶对姐姐来说\r\n可能还太早了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b74ca2d25e21eb811eab7da0484fe1d4e07ad7eb037e2ca01e0c58752b8e8ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:065cd3e4518388a7daba669d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要送姐姐巧克力，\r\n而是送我整个人好了～♪\r\n……你可以当真没关系哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18f61d36be8ea303585c3cc9d37f95d8af2f8fb2c13f7e1d87bff48ccd69a913",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abb271ca6266197263c59f61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望姐姐能够\r\n更加更加喜欢机伶♪\r\n姐姐，你要实现我的愿望哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "173c382872f0f55db0695b8eabac0a97f9302820580f00f7ff91b767e41d2323",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e7a01df02c5c81194b36c6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看！机伶是幽灵哦☆\r\n一旦附在姐姐身上，\r\n就再也不会～离开了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2ee88e18c73fab48d4bb416c7973a6ec95cb15d0afd86bc3f5b7db30a2c7fde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "10107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e6c40c1532adb57a57dcd6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐，姐姐！\r\n用天使机伶的圣歌，\r\n来拯救你的灵魂吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "775f7a25b7d6122c54ab00c75548dbdd4247a1752de882f4ca2a99f3a8927c33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
